==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*10 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Johnnyleon]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Tarsiriel]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Ackey]] spawns as the boss after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*5 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You don't need more than 2 meatshields here. First reach [[Worker Cat]] Lv4 using [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], then start deploying units that have low range or else Johnnyleon and Ackey will kill them. Now with them out of the picture, [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] can handle Doctor K.O. well enough with the support of [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]. As for Tarsiriel, just don't let it hit your units before they get close enough to Johnnyleon, thus a little bit of timing should do the job.

Now to brute-force your way into them, many units will work: [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]], [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]], [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]], etc. [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Catcrates]] is especially useful here, to the point that the stage may well be designed solely for him. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] with talents can destroy this stage if you slip it into the enemies' blindspot. Other viable units include [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], and [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]].

